WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.799 --> 00:00:05.990
Speaker 1: David, Rudy Giuliani is finally
formally under investigation.

00:00:05.990 --> 00:00:08.840
Do you think he will end up serving prison
time?

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:14.950
You know, every time I answer one of these
questions with no, he's not going to go to

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:23.859
prison, I get emails from people saying, David,
you fool, you are making it less likely that

00:00:23.859 --> 00:00:27.630
these people will go to prison by saying it's
unlikely they're going to go to prison.

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:31.229
No, I'm not my my show's audience.

00:00:31.229 --> 00:00:34.910
This show is just not nearly big enough for
me to say that and for it to have any kind

00:00:34.910 --> 00:00:36.239
of affect.

00:00:36.239 --> 00:00:39.190
Rudy Giuliani is not going to go to prison.

00:00:39.190 --> 00:00:42.530
Rudy Giuliani is 76 years old.

00:00:42.530 --> 00:00:46.230
And I'm not saying he shouldn't be investigated
or prosecuted as a result of that.

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:49.379
We now know there's an investigation into
Rudy going on.

00:00:49.379 --> 00:00:51.690
His home and office were raided last week.

00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:56.429
As we reported, he may have broken lobbying
law.

00:00:56.429 --> 00:00:57.949
He may have broken all sorts of laws.

00:00:57.949 --> 00:01:00.499
We don't know what's going on with Rudy Giuliani.

00:01:00.499 --> 00:01:05.910
It's possible that the investigation will
lead to charges for Rudy Giuliani if there

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:07.500
are charges against Rudy Giuliani.

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:12.840
The most common scenario that I would expect
because of Rudy Giuliani's place in society

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:19.080
and his access and his privilege would be
that there is some kind of a plea agreement

00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:20.880
or cooperation agreement.

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:26.400
Michael Cohen, Trump's former lawyer, believes
that Rudy would flip and spill the beans on

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:29.350
Trump because Rudy doesn't want to get in
trouble himself.

00:01:29.350 --> 00:01:33.250
So I think that there would be some kind of
plea deal if there's no plea deal.

00:01:33.250 --> 00:01:38.370
And it actually and if there is a plea deal,
anything Rudy pleads to would have no jail

00:01:38.370 --> 00:01:39.370
time.

00:01:39.370 --> 00:01:40.370
There's no doubt about it.

00:01:40.370 --> 00:01:43.840
Let's say there was no plea deal and this
thing actually goes to trial.

00:01:43.840 --> 00:01:45.520
Is it going to be a guilty verdict?

00:01:45.520 --> 00:01:48.270
I don't know if there is a guilty verdict.

00:01:48.270 --> 00:01:51.130
We're like four or five maybes in right now.

00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:56.810
If there is a guilty verdict, there may be
no jail time anyway associated with that as

00:01:56.810 --> 00:01:58.110
per the judge.

00:01:58.110 --> 00:02:04.570
And even if by this time when Rudy will be
77 or 78 or 79, who knows how long this thing

00:02:04.570 --> 00:02:07.560
could go on even if there is jail time?

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:13.180
I would fully expect that Rudy's lawyer, whoever
it is at the time, who knows how many lawyers

00:02:13.180 --> 00:02:15.200
Rudy will have been through at that point
in time.

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:19.840
I would expect Rudy's lawyer would successfully
argue that the sentence be suspended or that

00:02:19.840 --> 00:02:24.940
it be home confinement or whatever based on
Rudy's age and possible health situation.

00:02:24.940 --> 00:02:31.430
So when you put all of that together, I think
the odds of Rudy ever seeing any prison time

00:02:31.430 --> 00:02:37.251
are I mean, I think one in a thousand is when
these when the percentages are so small, it's

00:02:37.251 --> 00:02:40.300
hard to make them really tangible.

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:42.530
Is it one in a thousand that Rudy sees jail
time?

00:02:42.530 --> 00:02:44.880
I know it's not one in a hundred, is it?

00:02:44.880 --> 00:02:47.080
One in two thousand.

00:02:47.080 --> 00:02:51.130
But if I were a betting man on even odds,
I'm saying no, you would have to give me some

00:02:51.130 --> 00:02:56.290
crazy odds for me to bet that Rudy sees the
inside of a jail cell other than for some

00:02:56.290 --> 00:03:02.700
reason unrelated to him being being prosecuted
and charged, if you disagree with me.

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:06.390
Let me know I'm open to having my mind changed,
but I don't see it.

